!.env.example

# MaxMind GeoLite2 databases.
#
# Excluded for two reasons, both hard blockers:
#   1. Licence — the GeoLite2 EULA does not permit redistribution, so these must not
#      sit in a repository, public or private.
#   2. Size — GeoLite2-City.mmdb alone is ~57 MB. GitHub warns above 50 MB and
#      rejects above 100 MB, and because the files are replaced every month the
#      history would grow by that much each time.
#
# They are fetched at build time instead, using a MaxMind licence key held as a
# secret. See DEPLOYMENT.md. Their absence degrades gracefully — geo/ASN lookups
# return unknown rather than crashing (see geo-source.ts).
# A pattern containing a slash is anchored to this file's directory, so `data/geoip/`
# alone would NOT match `backend/data/geoip/` — which is exactly where they live. The
# `**/` prefix matches at any depth, and the bare `*.mmdb` (no slash, so also any
# depth) is the backstop that catches a database downloaded anywhere else.
**/data/geoip/
*.mmdb

